{
  "name": "3 - Contact and Draft",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SETUP, do this first\n\nBase/table are pre-filled on every Airtable node. Just:\n1. Workflow 2 must have already marked some tab #3 rows \"High Priority\".\n2. Go into Airtable, open each High Priority row, and type in the owner's Email by hand (found on the contact page / about page, see the framework doc, this step is manual on purpose).\n3. Click each Airtable node and pick \"Airtable Personal Access Token (Lead Gen $0 Framework)\"; click both Gemini Chat Model nodes and pick \"Google Gemini API\" (same credential as Workflow 2).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note 16",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        912,
        -512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Only Rows With an Email You Added by Hand\nEmail is never written by automation, you type it in tab #3 yourself. That is what makes a row eligible here.",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 836,
        "color": 4
      },
      "name": "Section - 1. Only Rows With an Email You Added by Hand",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -64,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. One Personalised Draft, One at a Time\nUses the exact problem + review quote found earlier. One lead per AI call, never batched.",
        "height": 636,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 5
      },
      "name": "Section - 2. One Personalised Draft, One at a Time",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        816,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. File in Tab #4, You Review + Send\nNothing is ever sent automatically. The draft sits in tab #4 for you to read, then send from Gmail by hand.",
        "height": 636,
        "width": 804,
        "color": 6
      },
      "name": "Section - 3. File in Tab #4, You Review + Send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1584,
        -256
      ]
    },
