          "cachedResultName": "3 - Analysed"
        },
        "filterByFormula": "AND(OR({Priority Tier} = 'High', {Priority Tier} = 'Medium'), {Email} != '', {Approved} = TRUE())",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Get Ready Leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        288,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Gate: (High OR Medium) AND Email present AND Approved ticked.\n\nMedium was added on 16 Aug 2026. This filter originally said High only, written when the only tiers were High and Not Ready - after the batch of 16 Aug just one lead reached High and it had no verified email, so nothing qualified at all.\n\nEmail is required on purpose: this workflow writes an outreach email, so with no address there is nothing to send. Unverified guesses are deliberately kept in 'Found Emails' and never in 'Email', so a guess can never be drafted to.\n\nApproved is a Checkbox on Tab 3. If it is missing or misnamed this node ERRORS rather than returning nothing - Airtable rejects formulas naming unknown fields. That loud failure is intentional."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
